{"language":"English","entry_date":"2026-05-15T09:11:31Z","report_number":"ORNL/TM-2026/4473","identifier":"AC05-00OR22725","country_publication":"United States","doi":"10.2172/3022101","description":"This document reports a detailed initial risk assessment associated with the exposure of liquid metal (LM) targets to plasma flux in the Material Plasma Exposure eXperiment (MPEX) at ORNL. This document, while preliminary, does give a comprehensive mitigation plan to the risks along with justification and recommendations before potentially proceeding to LM exposures. At the date of issuance of this report, the MPEX Project has completed Final Design, and the MPEX device is in the Fabrication stage. Remaining project stages include Commissioning of the device with plasma and transitioning to routine Operations for research. As will be described in this document, since the MPEX device is currently being fabricated and the existing design does not include sufficient engineering provisions for most LM targets, no LM exposures will be conducted in MPEX until further assessment can be conducted and the necessary engineering changes incorporated (during MPEX Operations.)","title":"Considerations and Mitigations for Liquid Metal Target Campaigns in the Material Plasma Exposure eXperiment","contract_number":"AC05-00OR22725; ","publication_date":"2026-03-01T00:00:00Z","osti_id":"3022101","product_type":"Technical Report","authors":["Trendler, Riley [Univ. of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign, IL (United States)]","Kumar, Atul [Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States)] (ORCID:0000000277475210)","Aaron, Adam [Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States)] (ORCID:0000000271149043)","Biewer, Theodore [Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States)] (ORCID:0000000174563509)"],"subjects":["70 PLASMA PHYSICS AND FUSION TECHNOLOGY"],"format":"77 p.","doe_contract_number":"AC05-00OR22725; ","sponsor_orgs":["USDOE Office of 